'''Agusan del Sur's 1st congressional district''' is one of the two [[Congressional districts of the Philippines|congressional district of the Philippines]] in the province of [[Agusan del Sur]]. It has been represented in the [[House of Representatives of the Philippines]] since 2010. Previously included in [[Agusan del Sur's at-large congressional district]] from 1987 to 2010, it encompasses the northern part of the province, bordering [[Agusan del Norte]]. It is currently represented in the [[20th Congress of the Philippines|20th Congress]] by [[Alfel Bascug]] of the [[National Unity Party (Philippines)|National Unity Party]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=House Members - 20th Congress |url=https://www.congress.gov.ph/house-members |access-date=2026-08-17 |website=[[House of Representatives of the Philippines]]}}</ref>

